WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.500
[Instrumental music with đàn tranh and strings]
YinYang Companion for Qudelix 5K. Open the EQ editor from Presets.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:12.100
Browser sync, private preview. Pair Android Phone in Sync & Devices.
Send Studio reference from the paired browser.

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:18.000
Review the incoming EQ as a local draft.
The two-filter preset has a −4.3 dB preamp.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.800
Download the Qudelix guide from website Tuning.
Choose Studio reference.txt in the Android file picker.

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:29.600
Save EQ and Channel Match as a pair.
Compare presets blind with Loudness match enabled.

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:39.200
The vertical slider moves through Blue, YinYang Green,
AMOLED, and Light while the EQ stays in place.

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:45.100
Simulated hardware volume moves down and back.
Android media volume stays at 15 of 15.

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:50.100
Set levels in the phone mixer.
Open Debug for the firmware check and combined log.

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:56.100
Simulated update from 0.9.7 to 0.9.8.
Manager verifies the download and Android confirms installation.

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:58.167
Share the Companion with friends and community.
yinyangeq.com/q5k4android
